---

Note on bundled third-party components. This repository does not vendor them,
but the playbook installs and invokes them:

  - bsbf-mptcp (bondingshouldbefree) — GPL-2.0-only. Invoked as a packaged
    binary; no source is copied into this repository.
  - xray-core — MPL-2.0. Invoked as a packaged binary.
  - The Linux kernel MPTCP implementation and iproute2 MPTCP support are
    upstream components used as-is.
